gle can really do?",2,""],["mrt",0,"z","025","question","lengzhan"],["say","avg3_100","Hey Tilia, how come the scooters the Imperial Guard uses in the city are so slow?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","004","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","The Lapis Eagle is one of a kind! The standard-issue ones are ...==W== just cheap knock-offs from failed wishes, though they still cost a fortune.",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_107","c","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_107","c","002","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","So, I had a friend help me soup it up and unlock its real power!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c","005",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","We could actually go even faster if I just open 'er up a little—",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","007","exclamation","Tiao"],["say","avg3_100","Less talking! Eyes on the road!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["se","se_391"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","007","shock",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Whoa!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c","004","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","... Phew. That was a close one.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","awkward",null],["say","avg3_100","Nice dodge. You swerved just in time.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Ah, sorry about that, Boss! Did I scare you? You're not hurt, are you?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","011","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","I'm fine. A little more excitement than I was ready for.==W== Just try to watch where you're going next time, okay?",1,""],["w",1],["mrt",0,"z","007","resentful","lengzhan"],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","You got it!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c","004","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","By the way, are you sure it's cool for you to tag along, Boss? I thought you had a shop to find.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","It's no problem, my errand can wait.==W== Besides, you'll be up against \"giants,\" right? Sounds like you could use the backup.",1,""],["w",1],["mrt",0,"z","014",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","002","music",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Boss...! Thanks!",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",1.0],["clear",1,0,1],["bg","grocery_store",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_line_goright_lp_w",1,2],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["show","avg1_107","a","006",0.4,null,null,0,null,null],["show","avg3_168","a","008",0.6,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_168","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",1.0],["say","Out-of-Breath Girl","The farm! Our farm is being attacked by giants!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","a","007","symbol",null,null,null,null,"Tiao","Linear",1.0],["tsk","Zhong"],["say","avg1_107","G-Giants?!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","a","002","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Don't worry, I'll handle this! Tilia, defender of justice, will take down those evil giants!",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["clear",1,0,1],["w",0.5],["bg","wild_tower_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_line_goright_lp_w",0,2],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["show","avg1_107","c","003",null,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","I've never even heard of a monster called a \"giant.\" You don't even know what the enemy is, how can you just take her word for it?",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","What if she's just a kid who got things mixed up?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","005","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","It's ... intuition of justice!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","021","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","\"Intuition of justice,\" right. But what about you? Does the Imperial Guard's jurisdiction even cover the area outside the city?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","007","awkward",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Uh, well, the Imperial Guard is just a security firm. We only patrol districts that have paid their fees, but...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","I'm off the clock! So I'm out here as a defender of justice. It's like Knight Justus always says: \"Justice strikes anywhere, anytime!\"",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","I guess she has a point, but I've got a bad feeling about this.",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Anyway, we gotta get there fast!==W== C'mon, Lapis Eagle, let's move!",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_107","c","006",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_107"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","007","flurry",null],["say","avg3_100","Hey, slow down!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_line_goright_lp_w",1,2],["clear",1,0,1],["w",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","field_daylight",0,0.0],["show","avg1_107","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["bgm","m33"],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_107","a","008","star",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","We're here! What a beautiful field of wheat!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","It's peaceful out here. I don't see any \"giants.\"",2,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_109","a","002",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_107","a","002",null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_109","a","006","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","Well now, Miss Knight. What wind blew you out to these parts?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","a","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","I'm not a knight, I'm a squire! Oh, wait, that's not it either. I'm not here as a squire today.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","a","012",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Let me reintroduce myself!==W== I'm Tilia, a Masked-Knight-in-Training, here to defeat the evil giants!",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_107","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_109","a","005","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","Giants? What in the world are those? We ain't got any strange critters like that 'round here.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Knew it. No way a creature from a fairy tale actually exists.",2,""],["bgm",""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","So ... has anything unusual been happening on your farm?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","The farm, let me think...==W== Oh! That's right! Those blasted giants are gonna wreck the whole place! And there's not just one, there are three of 'em!",0,""],["w",1],["bgm","m42"],["ctl","avg3_109","a","003","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","007","symbol","Tiao"],["say","avg3_100","There really are giants? And three of them?!",2,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","a","009","flurry",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Then take us to them, quickly!",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_107","a","006",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg3_109","a","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_218"],["obj","qstory_side_107_002",0,null,0.56],["ctl","avg1_107","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1],["mrt",1,"z","025",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Are those ... windmills?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["objx"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_107","a","015","flurry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Ugh, what a racket. Are the gears rusted out?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_109","a","005","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","Those are Giant #1, Giant #2, and Giant #3. They're United Harvest property. Been sitting here for ages, and not one person's come by for maintenance.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","So those are the girl's \"giants.\" Heh. They're certainly giant, alright.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_109","a","002","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","See for yourself. With those things hanging over our heads, you never know when one might come crashing down. We can't even harvest our wheat...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_107","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Did you contact United Harvest?",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["cbg",0,-120.0,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0,null,null,null],["bg","field_daylight",2,0.0],["stage",2,0,0],["ctl","avg1_107","a",null,null,0.15,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["show","avg3_166","a","002",0.3,null,null,2,null,0.0],["show","avg3_143","a","002",0.5,null,null,2,null,0.0],["se","se_102"],["ctl","avg3_166","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg3_143","a",null,null,0.6,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",1.0],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_166","a","006","awkward",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","For months! It's always the same excuse: \"We're looking into it,\" \"Filing a report,\" \"It's in process.\" But they never send anyone to fix it!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_109","a","002","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","Hey! What are you doing with those sickles?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_166","a","007","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Anxious Villager","What does it look like? We're harvesting wheat.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_109","a","003","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","For God of Grace's sake, you can't! That's too dangerous!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_166","a","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","Anxious Villager","Chief, look at those clouds.==W== Rain's coming in a day or two. We can't just let the whole harvest rot.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_166","a","005","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","Anxious Villager","We'll be careful. We just need to get the wheat out from under them before they collapse.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_102"],["ctl","avg3_166","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["hide","avg3_166",1.0],["ctl","avg3_143","a",null,null,0.7,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",1.0],["hide","avg3_143",1.0],["w",1],["cbg",0,0.0,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["ctl","avg1_107","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["stage",2,1,1],["w",1],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_109","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","Ugh, they're all going in... Please, just hold together for a little longer...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","a","009",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","This is dangerous! I have to help them.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_089"],["ctl","avg1_107","a",null,null,0.8,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["hide","avg1_107",1.0],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["hide","avg3_109"],["show","avg1_107","c","003",null,null,null,0,null,1.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["film",0],["say","0","Tilia nimbly vaults onto the Lapis Eagle, but she pauses as she reaches for her helmet.",3,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["se","se_077"],["w",0.5],["film",1],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Sigh...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","What's wrong? Not putting on your helmet?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","007","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","... If I shatter those blades ... am I just going to cause more problems for the villagers?",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["clear",1,0,1],["bg","grocery_store",0,0.0],["stg",0,-300.0,null,1.7,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_107","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,null],["ctl","avg1_107","a",null,null,0.33,-0.1,1.3,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["show","avg3_141","a","002",0.58,0.05,0.7,0,null,null],["show","avg3_144","a","002",0.77,0.05,0.7,0,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_144","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","Snarky Passerby","No way. An Imperial Guard actually lifting a finger for us common folk? As if.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_144","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",1.0],["say","Snarky Passerby","Probably spotted a Senator in the crowd.==W== Those Guards only care about kissing up to the powerful.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",1.0],["clear",1,0,1],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","field_daylight",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["show","avg1_107","c","003",null,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","And it's still United Harvest's property. If they want someone to blame and couldn't find me, they'll take it out on the villagers.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c","007","flurry",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","That company has a terrible reputation... Or ... should we just stand here and pray the blades don't fall? Is that the better choice?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Guess justice is never simple. In a situation like this, every option feels like a betrayal of what's truly right.",2,""],["bgm",""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["choice",["Pat Tilia on the shoulder"],[[]]],["ctl","avg1_107","c","004","shock",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Boss?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","017",null,"JuGong"],["bgm","m48"],["say","avg3_100","Think, but don't overthink, Tilia. That impulse you have to help people? That's never wrong.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","003","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","R-Really?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Don't sweat it, I'm here. If anything happens after, I'll fix it. My way.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","007","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","But if we actually cause trouble for the villagers, doesn't that make us the bad guys?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","006","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Perfect! As the Boss, I'm born to play the villain in a Masked Knight story. The clever, sneaky type.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_107","Well ... true. But there are cool villains too.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","019",null,null],["say","avg3_100","It's precisely because some villains are sneaky that they can pull moves a hero wouldn't dream of, or wouldn't dare to try. Trust me.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","014","happy","JuGong"],["say","avg3_100","Hey, even a Boss wants to back up an \"ally of justice\" sometimes.",1,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","c",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["show","avg3_109","a","003",0.5,null,null,0,null,null],["show","avg3_166","a","007",0.25,null,null,0,null,null],["show","avg3_143","a","008",0.75,null,null,0,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_218"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,"shock",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","Forgetful Village Chief","Oh no! The windmill blade—it's gonna fall!",0,""],["ctl","avg3_109","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg3_143","a",null,"symbol",null,null,null,null,"Tiao","Linear",1.0],["say","Flustered Villager","Wahh!?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_166","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","Anxious Villager","Everyone, run! Get out of the wheat field!",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["clear",1,0,1],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_107","c","004",null,null,null,0,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_107","d","002",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["se","se_100"],["say","avg1_107","Boss, clear everyone out!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_107","d",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["se","se_359"],["say","avg1_107","Lapis Eagle,==W== move!!",0,""],["se","se_107"],["ctl","avg1_107","d",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","018","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","After all that talk... When danger hits, she's still the first one to charge in.",2,""],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Yep. A true \"ally of justice.\"",2,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["se","se_128"],["say","0","In the golden wheat, Tilia raises her lance, a mirror image of the knights in stories charging toward a giant.",8,""],["end"]]}